  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">IFRC WASH regional agenda (2025-2026)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">IFRC Africa regional office, Nairobi, Kenya</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="3">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">IFRC Africa regional office, and African National Societies</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">In order to support the capacity of the IFRC Africa WASH regional team.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project aims to support the IFRC Africa WASH regional agenda in terms of training, coordination and technical guidance for water agenda. It includes funding to organize (regional) trainings, workshops, deployment, and covers two regional positions within the IFRC regional office.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Within this project we are collaborating closely with the IFRC Africa regional office, located in Nairobi, Kenya.</narrative>
  </description>
